    "\n",
    "**Why:** Colab wipes its disk when the session ends. We save checkpoints and the final model to your Drive so nothing is lost if the browser disconnects.\n",
    "\n",
    "**What happens:** A file picker appears. Click the link, authorize Google, paste the code back. Your Drive mounts at `/content/drive/MyDrive/`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
