    "## 📦 Download & Use in Your Rust Project\n",
    "\n",
    "Your model lives in Google Drive at `MyDrive/ParacleaVoice/`. Download these two files:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. `paraclea.onnx` → copy to `ai-avatar/models/`\n",
    "2. `paraclea.onnx.json` → copy to `ai-avatar/models/`\n",
    "\n",
    "Then update `ai-avatar/config.toml`:\n",
    "```toml\n",
    "[tts]\n",
    "model_path = \"models/paraclea.onnx\"\n",
    "model_json_path = \"models/paraclea.onnx.json\"\n",
    "use_mock = false\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Build with real TTS:\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "cargo run --release --no-default-features --features piper_tts\n",
    "```"
   ]
